      <p class="text-gray-300">BuyVM is one of the longest-running independent KVM VPS providers in the community-hosting space, founded in 2010 and now a division of Cloudzy. The company is best known for its KVM 256 plan at $25/year (≈$2.08/mo) with full root access, 3500 Gbps+ DDoS protection included free, and 100+ OS templates. Three datacenter locations (Las Vegas, New York, Luxembourg) give the plan unusually broad geographic reach for the price. The trade-off: SATA storage only (no NVMe tier), a lower RAM ceiling than hyperscalers, and unmanaged KVM with no managed services add-on.</p>
